Steps:
1. Send a POST request to /api/orders with the payload in testData. 2. Send a GET request to /api/orders/{orderId} using the orderId from the response in step 1.

Test Data: {
  "shopId": 1,
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerPhone": "+8801712345678",
  "customerGender": "MALE",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 101,
      "measurementGroups": [
        {
          "specialInstruction": "Urgent tailoring required",
          "measurements": [
            {
              "nameEn": "Special Notes",
              "nameBn": "বিশেষ নোট",
              "type": "TEXT",
              "textValue": "Extra stitching on collar"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

1. Send a PUT request to /api/orders/{orderId} with the payload in testData. 2. Send a GET request to /api/orders/{orderId} using the same orderId.

